  MCU["ESP32-S3 N16R8\n16MB Flash · 8MB PSRAM"]
  CAM["USB-UVC camera\nNative host/camera Type-C\nD− GPIO19 · D+ GPIO20"]
  OLED["0.96in SSD1306 OLED\nVCC 3.3V · GND common\nSDA GPIO40 · SCL GPIO42\nI2C address 0x3C"]
  MIC["INMP441 microphone\n3.3V · L/R → GND\nWS GPIO4 · SCK GPIO5\nSD GPIO6"]
  AMP["MAX98357A + speaker\nVIN 5V · GND common\nDIN GPIO7 · BCLK GPIO15\nLRC GPIO18 · SPK+/SPK− only"]
  US["CS100A ultrasonic\nVCC 5V · Trig GPIO1\nEcho → 10kΩ → GPIO2\nGPIO2 → 20kΩ → GND"]
  LED["WS2812 ×8\nExternal regulated 5V\nDIN GPIO3 via 330–470Ω\n470–1000µF across 5V/GND"]
  L298["L298N motor driver\nENA GPIO8 · ENB GPIO13\nIN1/2/3/4 GPIO9/10/11/12\nGND → common ground"]
  MOT["Four BO motors\nLeft pair → OUT1/OUT2\nRight pair → OUT3/OUT4\nEach side wired in parallel"]
  LOGIC["Regulated 5V logic supply\nESP32 host · camera · amplifier\nExternal 5V LED supply"]
  BAT["Separate motor battery\n+ → L298N VMOTOR/12V\n− → L298N GND"]
  GND["COMMON GROUND\nESP32 · OLED · mic · amp\nCS100A · WS2812 · L298N\nMotor battery negative"]

